<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-PAKISTAN V NEW ZEALAND SECOND TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN V NEW ZEALAND SECOND TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>RAWALPINDI, Pakistan 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the</p>
<p>first day of the second cricket test between Pakistan and New</p>
<p>Zealand on Thursday:</p>
<p>New Zealand first innings</p>
<p> B.Young lbw b Mushtaq Ahmad			   39</p>
<p> J.Vaughan lbw b Mohammad Zahid			12</p>
<p> A.Parore lbw b Mohammad Zahid			  3</p>
