<p> D.Patel not out					    6</p>
<p> Extras (lb-11 nb-9)				     20</p>
<p> Total (for eight wickets)			    215</p>
<p>Fall of wicket: 1-33 2-43 3-69 4-77 5-87 6-110 7-111 8-192</p>
<p>Bowling (to date): Mohammad Zahid 17-5-51-3 (nb8), Shahid</p>
